- Battery Recharge (3)
- Droid Strength (3)
- Magnetic Plating
- Cortosis (1)
- Elemental Resist (1)
- Adv. Radar (LPM Sense)
-- Active during Low Power Mode
- Adv. Logic (Anti-MT) (2)"